---
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 relative">
	<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<div class="text-center mb-16">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium text-[#38bdf8] bg-[#121826]/50 border border-[#334155]/50 mb-4">
				Engineering Philosophy
			</div>
			<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-[#f1f5f9] mb-4">
				Built for Autonomous Business
			</h2>
			<p class="text-[#94a3b8] max-w-2xl mx-auto">
				We build software that doesn't just observe—it acts.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
			<div class="text-center">
				<div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#6366f1]/20 to-[#38bdf8]/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-[#334155]/50">
					<svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#38bdf8]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
						<path d="M12 5.25L4.5 9v10.5c0 1.38.82 2.58 2.05 3.1l7.45 3.15c.27.11.55.16.83.16.28 0 .56-.05.83-.16l7.45-3.15c1.23-.52 2.05-1.72 2.05-3.1V9l-7.5-3.75z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-[#f1f5f9] mb-3">Agentic by Design</h3>
				<p class="text-[#94a3b8] text-sm leading-relaxed">
					Every workflow is built around autonomous agents that perceive, reason, and act—no human
					in the loop unless explicitly required.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="text-center">
				<div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#38bdf8]/20 to-[#10b981]/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-[#334155]/50">
					<svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#10b981]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
						<path d="M12 7.5V3M12 3L9 6.75M12 3L15 6.75M15.75 12.75V19.5C15.75 20.3284 15.0784 21 14.25 21H5.25C4.4216 21 3.75 20.3284 3.75 19.5V8.25C3.75 7.4216 4.4216 6.75 5.25 6.75H14.25C15.0784 6.75 15.75 7.4216 15.75 8.25V12.75Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-[#f1f5f9] mb-3">Privacy First</h3>
				<p class="text-[#94a3b8] text-sm leading-relaxed">
					We offer local AI inference via Ollama, so your data stays yours. No third-party
					auth, no vendor lock-in.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="text-center">
				<div class="w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#10b981]/20 to-[#f43f5e]/20 flex items-center justify-center border border-[#334155]/50">
					<svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#f43f5e]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
						<path d="M3 12c0 2.83 1.24 5.36 3.25 7.07l1.42-1.42C6.73 16.25 5.5 14.25 5.5 12c0-1.79.73-3.44 1.9-4.62L3.25 3.25C1.42 4.96 0.5 7.4 0.5 10.25c0 1.8.73 3.44 1.9 4.62l1.42-1.42z" transform="scale(0.8)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<h3 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-[#f1f5f9] mb-3">Data Sovereignty</h3>
				<p class="text-[#94a3b8] text-sm leading-relaxed">
					Self-hostable architecture on Vercel + Neon. Built-in MFA, audit logging, encryption
					at rest, and production-grade security from day one.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-16 text-center">
			<p class="text-[#94a3b8] text-sm">
				Built by a team of former SaaS operators, AI researchers, and financial engineers.
				Based in San Francisco and Addis Ababa.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
